</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.45</h2><ul><li><strong>Antigravity opens one sign-in page.</strong> Under Settings → Providers → Antigravity, Sign in opens one Google page and the code that page shows is pasted there; a failed, cancelled, or unsupported-region sign-in does not open another page immediately. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/116">#116</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.45">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
